Oversize loads / Restrictions
The Wyoming Highway Patrol requires any load travelling on a road within the WYDOT system, in excess
of 120-foot overall length, 18 feet wide, and/or 17 feet in height, contact the Overweight Loads Office at
the Wyoming Highway Patrol prior to hauling on the WYDOT system.
